<title>USA: Heart Labs says two directors resign.</title>
<headline>Heart Labs says two directors resign.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heart Labs of America Inc said on Monday Norman Birmingham and Edwin Russo have resigned from the company's board of directors to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Further details about the resignation were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
